{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"sync-rwlock-downgrade-001","description":"RwLock write-guard downgrade (Rust OwnedRwLockWriteGuard::downgrade, sync/rwlock.rs:1287; bd-rm2d gap). t.w holds the write lock while t.r1 (at 10), the writer t.wq (at 20) and t.r2 (at 30) queue. At 100 t.w downgrades: it keeps the lock as a reader and t.r1, queued before the first queued writer, is admitted with it; t.wq and t.r2 keep waiting. When both readers have released, t.wq writes, then t.r2 reads. t.r2's downgrade of a read guard observes ASX_E_NOT_FOUND.","unit":"sync","rules":["inv.determinism.replayable"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":2000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[],"sync":[{"name":"rw","type":"rwlock"}],"tasks":[{"name":"t.w","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"rwlock_write","rwlock":"rw"},{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"rwlock_downgrade","rwlock":"rw"},{"op":"trace","message":"w downgraded"},{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"rwlock_unlock","rwlock":"rw"},{"op":"trace","message":"w released"}]},{"name":"t.r1","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":10},{"op":"rwlock_read","rwlock":"rw"},{"op":"trace","message":"r1 read"},{"op":"sleep","ns":50},{"op":"rwlock_unlock","rwlock":"rw"}]},{"name":"t.wq","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":20},{"op":"rwlock_write","rwlock":"rw"},{"op":"trace","message":"wq wrote"},{"op":"rwlock_unlock","rwlock":"rw"}]},{"name":"t.r2","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":30},{"op":"rwlock_read","rwlock":"rw"},{"op":"trace","message":"r2 read"},{"op":"rwlock_downgrade","rwlock":"rw"},{"op":"rwlock_unlock","rwlock":"rw"}]}],"script":[],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
